{"parentUuid":"f4d7db2f-38c1-4819-8a91-1676b01d2f9a","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgEEU3wWyV3rDi2AuHxVU","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_017rmewDPKRKNcxgVPBr8d2D","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"git commit -q -F - <<'EOF'\nAdd Hedgerow, a third-person WW2 shooter: Saint-Clair at dusk\n\nA browser POC (three.js) for a mission-based third-person shooter: one\nhand-built level, evening and rain, through a Norman village, over the\nriver and into the forest, with alternative routes round the checkpoint,\nthe river and the trenches.\n\n- Engine: collision world with walkable routes, AI with cover, MG nests\n  and reloads, rifle and SMG reloads driven by the rig's event frames,\n  ragdoll deaths, grenades and charges, weather, lights, mist, distant\n  countryside with horizon treelines, HUD and menus.\n- Models built by headless Blender scripts (tools/blender/) and baked to\n  PBR: village, military, nature, soldier and weapons sets; soldiers with\n  per-enemy face blends from the rig's shape keys.\n- Node checks in tests/: collision world, every route walkable, wall\n  mounts, character aim/reload/faces, ragdoll, horizon treelines.\n\nPreview renders stay out of git (tools/blender/previews/.gitignore).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nEOF\ngit log --oneline -2 && git status --short | head -3 && git show --stat --format= HEAD | tail -1","description":"Commit the game to hedgerow-poc"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":684,"cache_read_input_tokens":508458,"output_tokens":632,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":684,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations"