; soldiers out of view","+    are not drawn and are posed five times a second), `mission.js`","   * `distance.js` the countryside beyond the level: a terrain ring of fields","     and woods to ~1 km with thousands of far-LOD trees, copses on the far","     hills, rings of layered treeline cards on the horizon (150–350 m, facing"]},{"oldStart":97,"oldLines":16,"newStart":102,"newLines":23,"lines":["   bunker flanks), with negative controls, and checks every wall lamp and","   ivy patch has a wall behind it;","   `tests/distance-check.mjs` — the horizon treelines face the level, sit","-  in the ground and leave the far village in sight:","+  in the ground and leave the far village in sight;","+  `tests/lod-check.mjs` — soldiers switch to low detail at a distance","+  (with a gap so they don't flicker), trees sort into full, mid and far:"," ","       node fun/hedgerow/tests/world-check.mjs","       node fun/hedgerow/tests/route-check.mjs","       node fun/hedgerow/tests/character-check.mjs","       node fun/hedgerow/tests/ragdoll-check.mjs","       node fun/hedgerow/tests/distance-check.mjs","+      node fun/hedgerow/tests/lod-check.mjs"," "," URL switches for testing: `?debug` (frame stats), `?god`, `?fly` (free"," camera; WASD, Q/E, Shift), `?at=x,z` (start elsewhere), `?go` (straight to"," the briefing), `?test=<glb>` (drop a model in front of the free camera)."," ","+Type: everything is set on the typewriter — Courier Prime (OFL) for the","+interface and Special Elite (Apache 2.0) for the wordmark and headings,","+self-hosted in `assets/fonts/` with their licences.","+"," Design notes: `docs/2026-10-19-hedgerow-design.md`."]}]}],"moreFiles":0,"changedFiles":["/Users/vojta/Dev/protocodus.github.io/.claude/worktrees/hedgerow/fun/hedgerow/README.md"],"shared":true}},"serverClassifierContext":{"request":"cc4b2667-cbae-4d6d-a8ce-fad71b8285ba","context":{"git_state":{"cwd":"/Users/vojta/Dev/protocodus.github.io/.claude/worktrees/hedgerow/fun/hedgerow","root":"/Users/vojt