{"type":"api-request-blob","sessionId":"8712e5cb-5c17-4f78-8159-fe8e322bd52d","hash":"69b564f334ad10a780d7a17b85991812b425df581e932d42ceb8575a48b9f680","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Writing the wind change now: tall trees sway less, and the distant treeline and hill cards stay still."},{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01DWCMn2ZQH11u9FFPwq1UUz","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"cd /Users/vojta/Dev/protocodus.github.io/.claude/worktrees/hedgerow/fun/hedgerow && python3 -I - <<'EOF'\np='js/materials.js'\ns=open(p).read()\nreps=[\n(\"      addWeather(m, shared, { porosity: cards ? 0.4 : 0.75, foliage: cards });\",\n \"      // the far treelines and copses are scenery cards tens of metres tall: no wind\\n      addWeather(m, shared, { porosity: cards ? 0.4 : 0.75, foliage: cards, sway: cards && src.name !== 'nat_far' });\"),\n(\"function addWeather(mat, shared, { porosity = 0.75, detailTex = null, tile = 1, foliage = false }) {\",\n \"function addWeather(mat, shared, { porosity = 0.75, detailTex = null, tile = 1, foliage = false, sway = foliage }) {\"),\n(\"  mat.customProgramCacheKey = () => 'hedgerow-' + (detail ? 'd' : 'b') + (foliage ? 'f' : '') + (mat.normalMap ? 'n' : '');\",\n \"  mat.customProgramCacheKey = () => 'hedgerow-' + (detail ? 'd' : 'b') + (foliage ? 'f' : '') + (sway ? 'w' : '') + (mat.normalMap ? 'n' : '');\"),\n(\"        ${foliage ? `{\\n          // wind: the higher, the more it moves; phase from where it stands\",\n \"        ${sway ? `{\\n          // wind: the higher, the more it moves (growing more slowly above\\n          // 14 m, so a 28 m spruce leans under a metre); phase from where it stands\"),\n(\"          float k = hgt * hgt * 0.0025 * gust;\",\n \"          float k = hgt * min(hgt, 14.0) * 0.0025 * gust;\"),\n]\nfor a,b in reps:\n    assert s.count(a)==1, a\n    s=s.replace(a,b)\nopen(p,'w').write(s)\nEOF\ngrep -n \"sway\" js/materials.js","description":"Cap tall-tree sway and disable it on far cards"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}]}}
