uilding any set with alpha cards (nature,\\nmilitary, village):\"\nassert a in s\ns=s.replace(a,\"Run `fix_card_alpha.py` after building any set with alpha cards (nature,\\nmilitary, village; the nature build now runs it itself):\")\nopen(p,'w').write(s)\nEOF\nsed -n 8,14p assets/models/MODELS.md","description":"Update README and MODELS.md for nature v3 and the new test"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}]}}
{"type":"api-request-blob","sessionId":"8712e5cb-5c17-4f78-8159-fe8e322bd52d","hash":"881dadf35a9e1c1983b42a30e6ed93b1c7d373f489ef78255b5925f4bb32b248","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_012PkWP6LUR9KyN1mzmagw4j","type":"tool_result","content":"| file | built by | contents | size |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| `village.glb` | `build_village.py` | 42 nodes: 7 houses (three with shell holes through a wall), barn, two ruins, church, walls, fences, bridge, street furniture, rubble, graves, ivy | 20.5 MB |\n| `military.glb` | `build_military.py` | 42 nodes: sandbags, MG nest, bunker, trench pieces, wire, vehicles and wrecks, Flak 38, PaK 40, crates, signs, camouflage net | 12.3 MB |\n| `nature.glb` | `build_nature.py` | 48 nodes: spruce, fir, Scots pine, oak, beech, birch, mature 21–28 m spruce, fir, oak and beech (+ far LODs), two horizon treelines and a hill copse, hedgerows, bushes, ground cover, rocks, logs | 13.4 MB |\n| `soldier.glb` | `build_soldier.py` | the rig (20 bones), US and German outfits, 17 animation clips (rifle and SMG reloads with their event frames) | 4.8 MB |\n| `weapons.glb` | `build_soldier.py` | M1 Garand, Thompson, Kar98k, MP 40, MG 42, two grenades, the clips and magazines used in reloads | 2.1 MB |","is_error":false}]}}
