{"type":"api-request-blob","sessionId":"8712e5cb-5c17-4f78-8159-fe8e322bd52d","hash":"8bb5b931d43f23abbb70b89389eb4e15a27bea220b11a385916bc7164def4706","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"","signature":""},{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Confirmed both causes. I'll redraw the cracks with a dirt halo and grime streaks, anti-alias the village's colour bakes, then run a single-house test bake before the full rebuild.\n\n","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01P3ZCvQcbQvZnkDBZc8b15z","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"cd /Users/vojta/Dev/protocodus.github.io/.claude/worktrees/hedgerow/fun/hedgerow && grep -n \"bake_model(\" tools/blender/build_village.py tools/blender/village_parts.py | head -20","description":"Find where the village calls the bake"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}]}}
