{"type":"api-request-blob","sessionId":"8712e5cb-5c17-4f78-8159-fe8e322bd52d","hash":"270c82289a77b932aef593baeb3e8ae2395bf76ed42189669f780bca33d4e93c","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"","signature":""},{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The close-up cracks look right now, but the wide shot still has too many of them forming closed cell shapes that reveal the underlying pattern. I'll reduce their number and break the closed cells into open, branching cracks—starting with the bake timing.\n\n","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01U58fgin6UUu1Gu1CGKLbrZ","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"cat $TMPDIR/vb/house_b.log | grep -v \"^Fra:\\|render  \\|Saved\" | head -30; ps aux | grep -i \"[B]lender\" | awk '{print $2, $3, $4, $10, substr($0, index($0,$11), 160)}' | head","description":"Read bake step timings and list running Blender processes"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}]}}
