{"type":"api-request-blob","sessionId":"8712e5cb-5c17-4f78-8159-fe8e322bd52d","hash":"1dda55cee287e11fd1913f382dbbfab3b4fd97fee9109d86e805e88239389720","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01LDRxej4PqUJeQzqdeZh1m4","name":"mcp__ccd_turn__update_plan","input":{"items":[{"content":"Look at how the plaster cracks are made","status":"completed"},{"content":"Rework the crack recipe and test-bake house_b","status":"in_progress"},{"content":"Rebake the full village","status":"pending"},{"content":"Verify the new village GLB and close-ups","status":"pending"},{"content":"Rerun the five node tests","status":"pending"},{"content":"Integrate the soldier rebuild when it lands","status":"pending"}],"scope":"continuation"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01GYLdZpzToULdHqUnxyBaKm","name":"mcp__ccd_turn__wrap_up","input":{"recap":"The cracks were dashed because each line was finer than a texture pixel and the colour bake used one sample per pixel. The first rework fixed that up close, but there were still too many cracks. A second version, fewer and open-branched, is test-baking on house_b now; the soldier rebuild is running alongside it."},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}]}}
{"type":"api-request-blob","sessionId":"8712e5cb-5c17-4f78-8159-fe8e322bd52d","hash":"42ed74317653e697a02c3b54946e855dbc288b77da2fb30f98142a287f55b4f6","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01LDRxej4PqUJeQzqdeZh1m4","type":"tool_result","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Plan shown (6 steps)."}]},{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01GYLdZpzToULdHqUnxyBaKm","type":"tool_result","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Nothing is pending, so the app draws no box; the recap is the session's status. Do not call wrap_up again this turn; the advice that follows is for your next call. recap is two or three sentences (about 300 characters); this one ran 313. Keep it to what is now true and where it stands. Your closing message is your answer to the user: write it now, as the last thing you say this turn."}]}]}}
