{"type":"api-request-blob","sessionId":"8712e5cb-5c17-4f78-8159-fe8e322bd52d","hash":"55d7885e082389da3e15d7753ee6bd98a949bc4431af9a792ee06636b49585da","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"","signature":""},{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The cracks now look convincingly real—tapered irregular lines, a cluster near the shell hole, and clean wall elsewhere—but the run-off stain noise is creating overly regular vertical stripes resembling panelling. I'll soften that into fewer, broader streaks as part of the village rebake.\n\n","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01MVJyqL2tsoSdGjJVLYETcb","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"cd /Users/vojta/Dev/protocodus.github.io/.claude/worktrees/hedgerow/fun/hedgerow && python3 -I - <<'EOF'\np='tools/blender/village_parts.py'\ns=open(p).read()\na=\"    streak = g.smooth(S.n(1.2, 4, 0.55, stretch=(5, 5, 0.35)), 0.6, 0.8)\\n    alb = g.mix(g.mul(streak, 0.28), alb, S.col('#5f5646'))\\n    # cracks:\"\nassert s.count(a)==1\ns=s.replace(a,\"    # run-off stains: a few broad soft streaks (more octaves made fine regular stripes)\\n    streak = g.smooth(S.n(1.2, 2, 0.5, stretch=(3, 3, 0.3)), 0.6, 0.8)\\n    alb = g.mix(g.mul(streak, 0.28), alb, S.col('#5f5646'))\\n    # cracks:\")\nopen(p,'w').write(s)\nEOF\ncd /Users/vojta/Dev/protocodus.github.io/.claude/worktrees/hedgerow && mkdir -p $TMPDIR/vb4 && TMPDIR=$TMPDIR/vb4 /Applications/Blender.app/Contents/MacOS/Blender --background --factory-startup --python fun/hedgerow/tools/blender/build_village.py -- house_b house_e --dev --no-preview --detail > $TMPDIR/vb4/test.log 2>&1; echo \"exit $?\"; grep \"baked\\|done in\\|Error\\|Traceback\" $TMPDIR/vb4/test.log","description":"Soften the stain streaks and test-bake house_b and house_e","timeout":600000},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}]}}
