{"type":"api-request-blob","sessionId":"8712e5cb-5c17-4f78-8159-fe8e322bd52d","hash":"07686d661918f1bee1e2e953166f12470dbdd7e20237f693e2819046af45c88e","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"","signature":""},{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The second pass clearly improves facial proportions, but the line-up shows only the strongly broad soldier stands out under current random weights. I'll adjust the game's random weights toward the extremes so more enemies get distinctly broad, gaunt, or older faces.\n\n","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01VRgk5MsExzfvdq4wxnWRBT","name":"mcp__ccd_turn__update_plan","input":{"advance":true},"caller":{"type":"direct"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01GQ7byixh45uB63EDGkuwRX","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"cd /Users/vojta/Dev/protocodus.github.io/.claude/worktrees/hedgerow/fun/hedgerow && python3 -I - <<'EOF'\np='js/character.js'\ns=open(p).read()\na=\"\"\"/* A face for one soldier: the head's shape keys (morph targets in the rig)\n   blended, from gaunt to broad, and some years older. */\nexport function randomFace(R = Math.random) {\n  const build = R() * 2 - 1;\n  return { face_broad: Math.max(0, build), face_gaunt: Math.max(0, -build), face_older: R() * R() * 0.9 };\n}\"\"\"\nassert a in s\ns=s.replace(a,\"\"\"/* A face for one soldier: the head's shape keys (morph targets in the rig)\n   blended, from gaunt to broad, and some years older. The build is pushed\n   away from the middle (square root) so most men are clearly one or the\n   other; age is spread evenly up to 0.9. */\nexport function randomFace(R = Math.random) {\n  const b = R() * 2 - 1;\n  const build = Math.sign(b) * Math.sqrt(Math.abs(b));\n  return { face_broad: Math.max(0, build), face_gaunt: Math.max(0, -build), face_older: R() * 0.9 };\n}\"\"\")\nopen(p,'w').write(s)\nEOF\nnode -e \"\nimport('./js/character.js').catch(()=>null);\n\" 2>/dev/null; node --check js/character.js && node tests/character-check.mjs 2>&1 | tail -1 && node --input-type=module -e \"\nlet r = 0.37; const R = () => (r = (r * 9301 + 49297) % 233280 / 233280);\nconst lineup = []; \nconst randomFace = (R) => { const b = R() * 2 - 1; const build = Math.sign(b) * Math.sqrt(Math.abs(b)); return { face_broad: Math.max(0, build), face_gaunt: Math.max(0, -build), face_older: R() * 0.9 }; };\nlet strong = 0; const N = 10000;\nfor (let i = 0; i < N; i++) { const f = randomFace(Math.random); if (f.face_broad > 0.5 || f.face_gaunt > 0.5 || f.face_older > 0.6) strong++; }\nconsole.log('share with at least one strong trait:', (strong / N).toFixed(2));\n\"","description":"Spread face weights and check the share of distinct faces"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}]}}
