xis: 7.78 ms\\n  without contact_shadow: 7.97 ms\\n  without soldier_axis: 7.80 ms\\n  without contact_shadow: 8.03 ms\\n  without soldier_axis: 7.85 ms\\n  without contact_shadow: 7.54 ms\\n  without soldier_axis: 7.88 ms\\n  without contact_shadow: 7.78 ms\\n  without soldier_axis: 7.83 ms\\n  without contact_shadow: 8.00 ms\\n  without soldier_axis: 7.90 ms\\n  without contact_shadow: 7.75 ms\\n  without soldier_axis: 7.63 ms\\n  without contact_shadow: 8.00 ms\\n  without soldier_axis: 7.56 ms\\n  without medkit: 7.88 ms\\n  without ammo_box: 7.87 ms\\n  without medkit: 7.84 ms\\n  without crate: 7.72 ms\\n  without ammo_box: 7.92 ms\\n  without medkit: 7.66 ms\\n  without medkit: 7.64 ms\\n  without ammo_box: 7.66 ms\\n  without medkit: 7.79 ms\\n  without crate: 7.74 ms\\n  without ammo_box: 7.72 ms\\n  without medkit: 7.88 ms\\n  without crate: 7.85 ms\\n  without medkit: 7.72 ms\\n  without ammo_box: 7.57 ms\\n  without medkit: 7.56 ms\\n  without kar98k: 7.59 ms\\n  without ammo_box: 8.06 ms\\n  without mp40: 7.86 ms\\n  without ammo_box: 7.72 ms\""},{"type":"text","text":"\n\nTab Context:\n- Executed on tabId: seed\n- Available tabs:\n  • tabId seed: \"Hedgerow — Saint-Clair at dusk\" (\"http://localhost:8765/fun/hedgerow/?debug&god&at=0,72&go\")"}]}]}}
