{"type":"api-request-blob","sessionId":"8712e5cb-5c17-4f78-8159-fe8e322bd52d","hash":"0c429f0ba356ac86510fed05629920203d964af2433f359431f8e109722ce2dd","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"","signature":""},{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Most results fall within measurement noise, but enemies (~1.8 ms), buildings/props (~1.3 ms), and vegetation (~1.2 ms) stand out as clear GPU time savers. I'll switch to the free camera to freeze the scene, capture stable baseline numbers at five spots, and test how much render resolution matters.\n\n","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_015jykxQRRtPd8ix86BaVvi3","name":"mcp__Claude_Browser__javascript_tool","input":{"action":"javascript_exec","text":"const G = window.hedgerow.G;\nwindow.VIEWS = { start: [0, 74, 0, -0.02], street: [0, 118, 0, -0.02], square: [2, 146, -0.35, 0.02], forest: [-4, 318, 0.1, 0.05], trench: [-12, 378, 0.35, -0.12] };\nwindow.viewGpu = async (label) => {\n  const out = [];\n  for (const [k, [x, z, yaw, pitch]] of Object.entries(VIEWS)) {\n    window.hedgerow.flyTo(x, G.terrain.height(x, z) + 1.7, z, yaw, pitch);\n    await new Promise((r) => setTimeout(r, 700));\n    out.push(`${k} ${(await gpuTime(15)).toFixed(2)}`);\n  }\n  return `${label}: ` + out.join(' | ') + ` ms (pr ${G.renderer.getPixelRatio()})`;\n};\nconst res = [await viewGpu('baseline')];\nG.renderer.setPixelRatio(0.5);\nres.push(await viewGpu('half resolution'));\nG.renderer.setPixelRatio(1);\nres.join('\\n')","tabId":"seed"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}]}}
{"type":"api-request-blob","sessionId":"8712e5cb-5c17-4f78-8159-fe8e322bd52d","hash":"e80026fe3063bc3769e1c4a277fba0c9ca2945abd98816d5eed7a4defda5b27e","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_015jykxQRRtPd8ix86BaVvi3","type":"tool_result","content":[{"type":"text","text":"\"baseline: start 8.99 | street 9.32 | square 7.50 | forest 10.46 | trench 10.02 ms (pr 1)\\nhalf resolution: start 8.35 | street 6.67 | square 7.72 | forest 7.47 | trench 5.96 ms (pr 0.5)\""},{"type":"text","text":"\n\nTab Context:\n- Executed on tabId: seed\n- Available tabs:\n  • tabId seed: \"Hedgerow — Saint-Clair at dusk\" (\"http://localhost:8765/fun/hedgerow/?debug&god&at=0,72&go\")"}]}]}}
