{"parentUuid":"200e3346-e94b-4746-b6f8-dcb426b4f855","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgF783Xb7pGwRDTVNXKya","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"The soldier low-detail models are done and checked. The trees are not: their build is still iterating and has just started another pass. Nothing is committed or pushed yet.\n\n**Soldiers**\n- **Boot-top specks:** the agent traced them to the boot shaft's smoothed normals tilting upward, which made the boots catch the light. It fixed those and also kept every low-detail face on its own texture region.\n- **Checks:** the new German render is clean in every pose at 10 m and 30 m. I confirmed by script that only the two low-detail meshes changed and that `weapons.glb` is identical to the committed file.\n- **Size:** soldier.glb is 7.27 MB, slightly over the 7 MB cap I'd set, from the low-detail meshes plus the normal fix. I've accepted that rather than run another rebuild.\n\nWhen the tree agent reports, I'll check its file and renders, run the six tests, then commit, rebase onto `main` and push."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":783,"cache_read_input_tokens":649527,"output_tokens":342,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":30},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":783,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":342,"cache_read_input_tokens":649527,"cache_creation_input_tokens":783,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":783},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"serverClassifierRequest":"e5b78077-8d2b-40e7-afad-7c9e6ac6b7d8","apiBlockIndex":1,"requestId":"re