{"type":"api-request-blob","sessionId":"8712e5cb-5c17-4f78-8159-fe8e322bd52d","hash":"9ed9a9a9447be1703ac279477f0c8c0e0569086b821ff6d5041b9b35b2bd8d3a","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"","signature":""},{"type":"text","text":"Goal set. I'll improve the graphics in rounds, judge each round in the browser against before-shots, run the tests, and commit each improvement separately on `hedgerow-poc`. Nothing gets pushed unless you ask.\n\nFirst I'm reading the current rendering pipeline: renderer setup, post-processing, lights, fog, effects."},{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_013g9egYetirupkWEPxYK4BD","name":"mcp__ccd_turn__update_plan","input":{"items":[{"content":"Read the rendering pipeline and take baseline shots","status":"in_progress"},{"content":"Round 1: volumetric light in the rain (lamps, fires, flashes)","status":"pending"},{"content":"Round 2: anti-aliasing for edges and foliage","status":"pending"},{"content":"Round 3: shadows from lamps and fires","status":"pending"},{"content":"Round 4: screen-space ambient occlusion","status":"pending"},{"content":"Round 5: cinematic grade, grain and aim depth of field","status":"pending"},{"content":"Round 6: wet-street reflections","status":"pending"},{"content":"Round 7: combat effects (flashes, impacts, smoke)","status":"pending"}],"scope":"new_task"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_013fzEo48S7Q26tyAsTGrQrf","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"cd /Users/vojta/Dev/protocodus.github.io/.claude/worktrees/hedgerow/fun/hedgerow && wc -l js/post.js js/bloom.js js/lights.js js/sky.js js/weather.js js/atmosphere.js js/effects.js js/materials.js js/main.js js/terrain.js && git -C .. log --oneline -1 && grep -n \"new THREE.WebGLRenderer\" -A 12 js/main.js","description":"Size up the rendering modules and the renderer setup"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}]}}
{"type":"api-request-blob","sessionId":"8712e5cb-5c17-4f78-8159-fe8e322bd52d","hash":"ee4014f49b86e7aa68f140a754ad3bb6ff085ebef4b69339b0454a3476788811","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_013g9egYetirupkWEPxYK4BD","type":"tool_result","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Plan shown (8 steps)."}]},{"tool_use_id":"toolu_013fzEo48S7Q26tyAsTGrQrf","type":"tool_result","content":"      66 js/post.js\n     177 js/bloom.js\n      91 js/lights.js\n     100 js/sky.js\n     229 js/weather.js\n     251 js/atmosphere.js\n     469 js/effects.js\n     310 js/materials.js\n     554 js/main.js\n     287 js/terrain.js\n    2534 total\n785fc024 Hedgerow: typewriter type, centred menus, faster rendering; list it with the games\n88:  renderer = new THREE.WebGLRenderer({\n89-    canvas, antialias: true, powerPreference: 'high-performance',\n90-    outputBufferType: hdr ? THREE.HalfFloatType : THREE.UnsignedByteType,\n91-  });\n92-  renderer.toneMapping = THREE.ACESFilmicToneMapping;\n93-  renderer.toneMappingExposure = 1.7;\n94-  renderer.outputColorSpace = THREE.SRGBColorSpace;\n95-  renderer.setPixelRatio(Math.min(window.devicePixelRatio || 1, quality.pixelRatio));\n96-  renderer.setSize(window.innerWidth, window.innerHeight, false);\n97-  renderer.info.autoReset = false;\n98-\n99-  scene = new THREE.Scene();\n100-  const fogColor = new THREE.Color(LEVEL.fog.color);","is_error":false},{"type":"text","text":"The user sent a new message while you were working:\nalso make ai smarter. the patrols patro, they investigate fire, grenade. if they spot you, they can investigate the last place they spot you. or they can see the direction you go and wait for you, covered. when someone kils you, move, point  the camera to the enemy who did and follow him.\n\nThis is how Claude Code surfaces messages the user sends mid-turn — within the running turn, often alongside the next tool result, rather than as a separate conversation turn. Address the message above as you continue this turn."}]}}
