{"type":"api-request-blob","sessionId":"8712e5cb-5c17-4f78-8159-fe8e322bd52d","hash":"c08ddf47368d3b437f23bd07dbacf70786df21f1c64c219f6a1ad0a8a5aa6133","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"","signature":""},{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The straight-line path actually clips 15 cm into a house corner that the grid missed since it only checks cell centers 2 m apart. I'll have `lineClear` cast raycasts at knee height along the line and at body width on either side, so let me check `raycast`'s options first.\n\n","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01UzfR5SVxpP9NtdEmJ79Sig","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"cd /Users/vojta/Dev/protocodus.github.io/.claude/worktrees/hedgerow/fun/hedgerow && sed -n 157,216p js/world.js","description":"Read the world raycast implementation"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}]}}
