{"type":"api-request-blob","sessionId":"8712e5cb-5c17-4f78-8159-fe8e322bd52d","hash":"4b9ad881824bac818573c59d62cd1faecb8378d7f7fcd7ae24deeb543fbcb538","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"","signature":""},{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Found the bug: the standing-view check was only applied to low cover, so tall cover like wall corners skips it, leaving him facing the spot but never firing. I'll update the logic to require a clear standing view of the watched spot for every ambush position, regardless of cover type.\n\n","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01DGUNqjbUNNWYJD1tpJ1tSL","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"cd /Users/vojta/Dev/protocodus.github.io/.claude/worktrees/hedgerow/fun/hedgerow && python3 -I - <<'EOF'\np='js/ai.js'\ns=open(p).read()\na=\"\"\"      if (G.world.clear(c.x, c.y + 0.95, c.z, pred.x, py, pred.z, SHOT)) continue;\n      if (c.low && !G.world.clear(c.x, c.y + 1.55, c.z, pred.x, py + 0.3, pred.z, SIGHT)) continue;\"\"\"\nb=\"\"\"      // hidden crouching, but standing (rising to look) he sees the spot\n      if (G.world.clear(c.x, c.y + 0.95, c.z, pred.x, py, pred.z, SHOT)) continue;\n      if (!G.world.clear(c.x, c.y + 1.55, c.z, pred.x, py + 0.3, pred.z, SIGHT)) continue;\"\"\"\nassert s.count(a)==1\ns=s.replace(a,b)\nopen(p,'w').write(s)\nEOF\nnode tests/ai-check.mjs 2>&1 | grep -v \"^    at \\|node:internal\\|triggerUncaught\\|^\\s*\\^$\\|^$\" | head -12","description":"Require a standing view of the ambush spot, rerun","timeout":300000},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}]}}
