{"type":"api-request-blob","sessionId":"8712e5cb-5c17-4f78-8159-fe8e322bd52d","hash":"afee9a6a739c6fa3e1f7c5bdc0448416e81803f8e8cd24d7617d37d12729c02e","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"","signature":""},{"type":"text","text":"Now the composite in the rain-in-the-air pass: the occlusion upsample already computes depth weights, so the reflections reuse them."},{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01WuM48KxusQjjyuZEHKShqA","name":"Edit","input":{"file_path":"/Users/vojta/Dev/protocodus.github.io/.claude/worktrees/hedgerow/fun/hedgerow/js/volumetric.js","old_string":"   It also lays the ambient occlusion of ssao.js onto the scene first: the\n   half-resolution occlusion brought up with a depth-aware 3 x 3 filter\n   (so it does not bleed across edges), sparing bright pixels — lamps,\n   fires and lit windows are not darkened by what is near them. */","new_string":"   It also lays the ambient occlusion of ssao.js and the reflections of\n   ssr.js onto the scene first: both half-resolution, brought up with one\n   depth-aware 3 x 3 filter (so they do not bleed across edges). The\n   occlusion spares bright pixels — lamps, fires and lit windows are not\n   darkened by what is near them — and so do the reflections, which take\n   the place of what the material reflected (the sky) in proportion to how\n   mirror-like the scene pass says the pixel is (its alpha). */"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_016bovY3JJ8cLb8ej6Q1YH5K","name":"Edit","input":{"file_path":"/Users/vojta/Dev/protocodus.github.io/.claude/worktrees/hedgerow/fun/hedgerow/js/volumetric.js","old_string":"uniform sampler2D tAO;\nuniform vec2 uAOTexel;\nuniform float uAO;\nvarying vec2 vUv;\n\nfloat viewZ(vec2 uv) {\n  float d = texture2D(tDepth, uv).x;\n  vec4 v = uProjInv * vec4(uv * 2.0 - 1.0, d * 2.0 - 1.0, 1.0);\n  return v.z / v.w;\n}\nfloat occlusion(vec2 uv, float z0) {\n  float sum = 0.0, wsum = 0.0;\n  for (int j = -1; j <= 1; j++) for (int i = -1; i <= 1; i++) {\n    vec2 o = vec2(float(i), float(j)) * uAOTexel;\n    float w = (i == 0 && j == 0 ? 2.0 : 1.0) / (0.02 + abs(viewZ(uv + o) - z0));\n    sum += texture2D(tAO, uv + o).r * w;\n    wsum += w;\n  }\n  return sum / wsum;\n}","new_string":"uniform sampler2D tAO, tSSR;\nuniform vec2 uAOTexel;\nuniform float uAO, uSSR;\nvarying vec2 vUv;\n\nfloat viewZ(vec2 uv) {\n  float d = texture2D(tDepth, uv).x;\n  vec4 v = uProjInv * vec4(uv * 2.0 - 1.0, d * 2.0 - 1.0, 1.0);\n  return v.z / v.w;\n}\n// the half-resolution layers brought up to full size, weighted by depth likeness\nvoid layers(vec2 uv, float z0, bool refl, out float ao, out vec4 rf) {\n  float wsum = 0.0;\n  ao = 0.0; rf = vec4(0.0);\n  for (int j = -1; j <= 1; j++) for (int i = -1; i <= 1; i++) {\n    vec2 o = vec2(float(i), float(j)) * uAOTexel;\n    float w = (i == 0 && j == 0 ? 2.0 : 1.0) / (0.02 + abs(viewZ(uv + o) - z0));\n    ao += texture2D(tAO, uv + o).r * w;\n    if (refl) rf += texture2D(tSSR, uv + o) * w;\n    wsum += w;\n  }\n  ao /= wsum; rf /= wsum;\n}"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01YPcFuJLHuerX11MimXScbW","name":"Edit","input":{"file_path":"/Users/vojta/Dev/protocodus.github.io/.claude/worktrees/hedgerow/fun/hedgerow/js/volumetric.js","old_string":"void main() {\n  vec3 col = texture2D(tSrc, vUv).rgb;\n  float d = texture2D(tDepth, vUv).x;\n  // the view ray and the distance to what this pixel shows\n  vec4 v = uProjInv * vec4(vUv * 2.0 - 1.0, d * 2.0 - 1.0, 1.0);\n  v.xyz /= v.w;\n  float T = d >= 1.0 ? uFar : min(length(v.xyz), uFar);\n  if (uAO > 0.0 && d < 1.0) {\n    float ao = occlusion(vUv, v.z);\n    float lum = dot(col, vec3(0.2126, 0.7152, 0.0722));\n    col *= mix(1.0, ao, uAO * (1.0 - smoothstep(0.8, 5.0, lum)));\n  }","new_string":"void main() {\n  vec4 src = texture2D(tSrc, vUv);\n  vec3 col = src.rgb;\n  float d = texture2D(tDepth, vUv).x;\n  // the view ray and the distance to what this pixel shows\n  vec4 v = uProjInv * vec4(vUv * 2.0 - 1.0, d * 2.0 - 1.0, 1.0);\n  v.xyz /= v.w;\n  float T = d >= 1.0 ? uFar : min(length(v.xyz), uFar);\n  // how mirror-like the scene pass says this pixel is (mirrorAlpha in terrain.js)\n  float mirror = uSSR * clamp(1.0 - src.a * 4.0, 0.0, 1.0);\n  if ((uAO > 0.0 || mirror > 0.0) && d < 1.0) {\n    float ao; vec4 rf;\n    layers(vUv, v.z, mirror > 0.0, ao, rf);\n    float lum = dot(col, vec3(0.2126, 0.7152, 0.0722));\n    col *= mix(1.0, ao, uAO * (1.0 - smoothstep(0.8, 5.0, lum)));\n    if (rf.a > 1e-4) col = mix(col, rf.rgb / rf.a, rf.a * mirror * (1.0 - smoothstep(1.5, 6.0, lum)));\n  }"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_011wTETEASyBVJ5DLsQ9o2Ln","name":"Edit","input":{"file_path":"/Users/vojta/Dev/protocodus.github.io/.claude/worktrees/hedgerow/fun/hedgerow/js/volumetric.js","old_string":"      tAO: { value: null }, uAOTexel: { value: new THREE.Vector2(1, 1) }, uAO: { value: 0 },","new_string":"      tAO: { value: null }, uAOTexel: { value: new THREE.Vector2(1, 1) }, uAO: { value: 0 },\n      tSSR: { value: null }, uSSR: { value: 0 },"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01KDtTQVsGvfm1kZP6YJD39z","name":"Edit","input":{"file_path":"/Users/vojta/Dev/protocodus.github.io/.claude/worktrees/hedgerow/fun/hedgerow/js/volumetric.js","old_string":"    setAO(ssao, strength = 0.85) {\n      u.tAO.value = ssao ? ssao.texture : null;\n      u.uAOTexel.value = ssao ? ssao.uniforms.uTexel.value : u.uAOTexel.value;\n      u.uAO.value = ssao ? strength : 0;\n    },","new_string":"    setAO(ssao, strength = 0.85) {\n      u.tAO.value = ssao ? ssao.texture : null;\n      u.uAOTexel.value = ssao ? ssao.uniforms.uTexel.value : u.uAOTexel.value;\n      u.uAO.value = ssao ? strength : 0;\n    },\n    /* the reflections pass to lay on (ssr.js, at the occlusion's half\n       resolution: the upsample shares its texel), and how strongly */\n    setSSR(ssr, strength = 1) {\n      u.tSSR.value = ssr ? ssr.texture : null;\n      u.uSSR.value = ssr ? strength : 0;\n    },"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}]}}
